# Music/narration mp3s are served from Vercel Blob storage (see MEDIA_BASE in src/lib/music.ts
# and src/data/realWorldReadings.ts), not committed — every deployment used to ship a full copy
# of these, which drove Vercel's deployment storage quota up on every single push. These
# directories are only ever transient local staging between generating/adding a track and running
# scripts/upload-media-to-blob.ts.
public/music/
public/audio/real-world/
